    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You tell \u2018em I\u2019m coming\u2026 and Hell\u2019s coming with me!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast draw your gun in kill-or-be-killed duels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dyin\u2019 ain\u2019t much of a livin\u2019, boy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an original puzzle game inspired by chess. Using chess Knights, you need to move through the board until you reach the squares where you can shoot and kill other pieces. Kill everyone in your way and duel against the Wanted Ones to become a Legendary gunslinger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Story Mode</strong>: Hunt and kill the deadliest gunslingers in the Old West. Each narrative features 15 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity - and a kill-or-be-killed duel in the end! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Duel Mode</strong> Face 100+ hand-crafted Duel Puzzles and prove yourself to be a legendary gunslinger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Original soundtrack </strong>inspired by classical Western movies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All pieces move like in a chess game, but the objective is to use your Knights to kill the other pieces that are in your way.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You tell \u2018em I\u2019m coming\u2026 and Hell\u2019s coming with me!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/0109532fae9f147feae5d4ca4f1c960b.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast draw your gun in kill-or-be-killed duels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/7a5011bcfa28a48f6f82c74f692e506f.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dyin\u2019 ain\u2019t much of a livin\u2019, boy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.poster.avif?t=1730138094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.webm?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486800/extras/ff9a5cca7ba14648f260ecbf03e849ed.mp4?t=1730138094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an original puzzle game inspired by chess. Using chess Knights, you need to move through the board until you reach the squares where you can shoot and kill other pieces. Kill everyone in your way and duel against the Wanted Ones to become a Legendary gunslinger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Story Mode</strong>: Hunt and kill the deadliest gunslingers in the Old West. Each narrative features 15 hand-crafted levels with increasing complexity - and a kill-or-be-killed duel in the end! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Duel Mode</strong> Face 100+ hand-crafted Duel Puzzles and prove yourself to be a legendary gunslinger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Original soundtrack </strong>inspired by classical Western movies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All pieces move like in a chess game, but the objective is to use your Knights to kill the other pieces that are in your way.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Chess Knights: High Noon you are one of the deadliest gunslingers of the Old West. Use your instincts and fast trigger skills to hunt and kill all the Wanted Ones. Do it for fame or simply for a fistful of dollars.",
